201	609	page	join	{"slug":"join","status":"published","user_created":"457dbbb9-5eb6-491d-9c18-095db7fffc84","date_created":"2024-09-10T20:43:04.839Z","user_updated":"cfd32bb9-5bce-4724-8ef3-1a01b9714c9f","date_updated":"2024-09-16T15:08:12.787Z","publish_date":null,"title":"WELCOME TO THE LIGERBOTS","subtitle":null,"content":"<center><br><iframe title=\\"YouTube video player\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Y_tL6csFOHc?si=AGVOR4u3GfAQdFFs\\" width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen=\\"allowfullscreen\\" referrerpolicy=\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\"></iframe></center>\\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\\n<!-- header -->\\n<div class=\\"level4-heading\\"><a name=\\"open_house\\"></a> Come to the LigerBots Open House, Mon., 9/30, 6:15 &ndash; 9:00!</div>\\n<p>The LigerBots will host an open house for prospective team members on Sept. 30, 2024 from 6:15 &ndash; 9:00 p.m. in the tech ed room at Newton South High School, room 9170. All Newton North and Newton South students are invited. This exciting event will include an introductory presentation about the team and hands-on challenges in many of the skill areas that we learn on our team, like mechanical and electrical engineering, programming, driving robots, CAD (Computer Aided Design), marketing, graphics, photography, and public speaking. Masks are encouraged but not required at LigerBots meetings. Closed-toed shoes are required in the LigerBots shop. For more information, email info@ligerbots.org.</p>\\n<div class=\\"level4-heading\\"><a name=\\"how_to_join_the_team\\"></a>How to Join the Team</div>\\n<p>To join the LigerBots, please go to <a href=\\"https://ligerbots.org/register.php\\">https://ligerbots.org/register.php</a>. To ensure that the form works properly, please fill it out in the Chrome browser. List a Gmail address that is not one used for Newton Public Schools. Once we have verified your information you will receive an invitation email from the team.</p>\\n<!-- /wp:tadv/classic-paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>If you would simply like to hear more about the team (no commitment required) please fill out the interest form, below, and we will contact you shortly. If you would like to help the LigerBots with mentoring or other opportunities, please <a href=\\"/contact\\">contact the Coaches and Execs</a>.</p>\\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>In September, meetings will be:</p>\\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list -->\\n<ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\\n<li>Mondays, 6:30-9:00 p.m., at Newton North in the Engineering Room.</li>\\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\\n<li>Thursdays, 6:30-9:00 p.m., at Newton South in the Wood Shop, Room 9170.</li>\\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\\n<!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:tadv/classic-paragraph -->\\n<p>Please check the website calendar page (also shown on the home page) for meeting location details.</p>\\n<p>Masks are encouraged but not required at LigerBots meetings.</p>\\n<!-- /wp:tadv/classic-paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:tadv/classic-paragraph --><center><br><!--iframe src=\\"http://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScDs47CsXPi-mNstZ1lCnQ4A6eNmbsb-_S9HotfLp8QFd3acQ/viewform?embedded=true\\" width=\\"640\\" height=\\"980\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" marginwidth=\\"0\\" marginheight=\\"0\\" sandbox=\\"\\">Loading…</iframe --></center>"}	{"content":"<center><br><iframe title=\\"YouTube video player\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Y_tL6csFOHc?si=AGVOR4u3GfAQdFFs\\" width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen=\\"allowfullscreen\\" referrerpolicy=\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\"></iframe></center>\\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\\n<!-- header -->\\n<div class=\\"level4-heading\\"><a name=\\"open_house\\"></a> Come to the LigerBots Open House, Mon., 9/30, 6:15 &ndash; 9:00!</div>\\n<p>The LigerBots will host an open house for prospective team members on Sept. 30, 2024 from 6:15 &ndash; 9:00 p.m. in the tech ed room at Newton South High School, room 9170. All Newton North and Newton South students are invited. This exciting event will include an introductory presentation about the team and hands-on challenges in many of the skill areas that we learn on our team, like mechanical and electrical engineering, programming, driving robots, CAD (Computer Aided Design), marketing, graphics, photography, and public speaking. Masks are encouraged but not required at LigerBots meetings. Closed-toed shoes are required in the LigerBots shop. For more information, email info@ligerbots.org.</p>\\n<div class=\\"level4-heading\\"><a name=\\"how_to_join_the_team\\"></a>How to Join the Team</div>\\n<p>To join the LigerBots, please go to <a href=\\"https://ligerbots.org/register.php\\">https://ligerbots.org/register.php</a>. To ensure that the form works properly, please fill it out in the Chrome browser. List a Gmail address that is not one used for Newton Public Schools. Once we have verified your information you will receive an invitation email from the team.</p>\\n<!-- /wp:tadv/classic-paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>If you would simply like to hear more about the team (no commitment required) please fill out the interest form, below, and we will contact you shortly. If you would like to help the LigerBots with mentoring or other opportunities, please <a href=\\"/contact\\">contact the Coaches and Execs</a>.</p>\\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>In September, meetings will be:</p>\\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list -->\\n<ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\\n<li>Mondays, 6:30-9:00 p.m., at Newton North in the Engineering Room.</li>\\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\\n<li>Thursdays, 6:30-9:00 p.m., at Newton South in the Wood Shop, Room 9170.</li>\\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\\n<!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:tadv/classic-paragraph -->\\n<p>Please check the website calendar page (also shown on the home page) for meeting location details.</p>\\n<p>Masks are encouraged but not required at LigerBots meetings.</p>\\n<!-- /wp:tadv/classic-paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:tadv/classic-paragraph --><center><br><!--iframe src=\\"http://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScDs47CsXPi-mNstZ1lCnQ4A6eNmbsb-_S9HotfLp8QFd3acQ/viewform?embedded=true\\" width=\\"640\\" height=\\"980\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" marginwidth=\\"0\\" marginheight=\\"0\\" sandbox=\\"\\">Loading…</iframe --></center>","user_updated":"cfd32bb9-5bce-4724-8ef3-1a01b9714c9f","date_updated":"2024-09-16T15:08:12.787Z"}	\N	\N
