he Wood Shop, Room 9170.</li>\\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\\n<!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:tadv/classic-paragraph -->\\n<p>Please check the website calendar page (also shown on the home page) for meeting location details.</p>\\n<p>Masks are encouraged but not required at LigerBots meetings.</p>\\n<!-- /wp:tadv/classic-paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<center><br><iframe src=\\"http://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScDs47CsXPi-mNstZ1lCnQ4A6eNmbsb-_S9HotfLp8QFd3acQ/viewform?embedded=true\\" width=\\"640\\" height=\\"980\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" marginwidth=\\"0\\" marginheight=\\"0\\" sandbox=\\"\\">Loading…</iframe></center>","user_updated":"cfd32bb9-5bce-4724-8ef3-1a01b9714c9f","date_updated":"2024-09-16T15:11:29.724Z"}	\N	\N
