ore information, email <a href=\\"mailto:info@ligerbots.org\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">info@ligerbots.org</a> or visit our team website at <a href=\\"http://ligerbots.org\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">ligerbots.org</a>.</p>","user_updated":"cfd32bb9-5bce-4724-8ef3-1a01b9714c9f","date_updated":"2024-09-30T16:32:58.271Z"}	\N	\N
