1	published	cfd32bb9-5bce-4724-8ef3-1a01b9714c9f	2024-09-30 15:56:00.301+00	cfd32bb9-5bce-4724-8ef3-1a01b9714c9f	2024-10-06 18:52:40.632+00	announcement	ligerbots-open-house-sept-30-630-900	LigerBots Open House Sept. 30, 6:30-9:00	<p>The LigerBots, will host an open house for prospective team members on Sept. 30, 2024 from 6:15 &ndash; 9:00 p.m. in the tech ed room at Newton South High School.</p>\n<p>All Newton North and Newton South students are invited.</p>\n<p>This exciting event will include an introductory presentation about the team and hands-on challenges in many of the skill areas that we learn on our team, like mechanical and electrical engineering, programming, driving robots, CAD (Computer Aided Design), marketing, graphics, photography, and public speaking.</p>\n<p>Masks are encouraged but not required at LigerBots meetings. Closed-toed shoes are required in the LigerBots shop.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>For more information, email&nbsp;<a href="mailto:info@ligerbots.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">info@ligerbots.org</a> or visit our team website at <a href="http://ligerbots.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ligerbots.org</a>.</p>	5cb155f4-004a-401f-a3b8-3910ae7f137a	2024-09-05	t	<p>The LigerBots, will host an open house for prospective team members on Sept. 30, 2024 from 6:15 &ndash; 9:00 p.m. in the tech ed room at Newton South High School.</p>
